  "description": "SportSDK provides high level abstraction to get scores from major US professional leagues as well as top european soccer leagues and competitions.\n\nLeagues included: MLB, NHL, NBA, WNBA, Italian Serie A, Spanish La Liga, English Premier League, German Bundesliga, French Ligue 1.\nCompetitions: UEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League, UEFA Conference League.",
